# Astro + TS

- Use content collections + Zod in `src/content.config.ts`; type-safe `getCollection` / `getEntry`.
- Pages: thin orchestration; reuse `Container`, `SectionHeading`, layout SEO props.
- Prefer `.astro` for static markup; React/Vue islands only when interactivity is required.
- Import site meta from `@/config/site` (or project alias). Strict TS — no `any` for content.
- Images: Astro assets or `public/`; lazy-load non-critical images.
